WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:12.894
Vinnie and Mandy followed Gildong to the nobleman's house.

2
00:00:12.895 --> 00:00:16.285
He led them through a busy street.

3
00:00:16.286 --> 00:00:20.909
Suddenly Mandy noticed something strange.

4
00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:26.256
"Why are so many people wearing white?" she asked.

5
00:00:26.257 --> 00:00:28.672
Gildong laughed.

6
00:00:28.673 --> 00:00:33.242
"You must be from very far away," he said.

7
00:00:33.243 --> 00:00:37.029
"In Korea poor people usually wear white.

8
00:00:37.030 --> 00:00:40.508
Only nobles and royalty can wear colors."

9
00:00:40.509 --> 00:00:47.122
"So that's where we are!" thought Mandy. "Korea!"

10
00:00:47.123 --> 00:00:51.251
Soon the children reached a large house.

11
00:00:51.252 --> 00:00:55.173
In the courtyard people looked very busy.

12
00:00:55.174 --> 00:00:59.826
"They are getting ready for a special ceremony," said Gildong.

13
00:00:59.827 --> 00:01:05.501
Vinnie watched a woman pounding something with a thick stick.

14
00:01:05.502 --> 00:01:09.306
"She's pounding rice," explained Gildong.

15
00:01:09.307 --> 00:01:13.511
The children saw a room with a big table.

16
00:01:13.512 --> 00:01:16.781
A girl was placing food there.

17
00:01:16.782 --> 00:01:20.508
"I'm hungry," Mandy said.

18
00:01:20.509 --> 00:01:25.280
"Sorry, but the food is for the ceremony," said Gildong.

19
00:01:25.281 --> 00:01:29.125
"Tonight they are remembering the nobleman's grandfather.

20
00:01:29.126 --> 00:01:32.661
He died on this day many years ago."

21
00:01:32.662 --> 00:01:36.383
"I don't understand," said Mandy.

22
00:01:36.384 --> 00:01:40.580
"Why are they making food for someone who died?"

23
00:01:40.581 --> 00:01:47.095
"The family honors their grandfather by offering wine and food," said Gildong.

24
00:01:47.096 --> 00:01:49.095
Mandy nodded.

25
00:01:49.096 --> 00:01:53.985
Vinnie asked where the food would go after the ceremony.

26
00:01:53.986 --> 00:01:59.132
"The nobleman's family will share it with others," Gildong said.

27
00:01:59.133 --> 00:02:02.487
"That's an important part of the ceremony."

28
00:02:02.488 --> 00:02:05.745
"Gildong!" a voice shouted.

29
00:02:05.746 --> 00:02:10.534
The children turned to see an old woman waving at them.

30
00:02:10.535 --> 00:02:14.045
"Finally!" she said to Gildong.

31
00:02:14.046 --> 00:02:16.683
"You have come with the bowls!

32
00:02:16.684 --> 00:02:21.367
We are thankful your father could make these for us."

33
00:02:21.368 --> 00:02:26.732
Gildong unwrapped the basket and gave the bowls to the woman.

34
00:02:26.733 --> 00:02:30.142
"May I look at one?" asked Mandy.

35
00:02:30.143 --> 00:02:33.886
"Yes." The woman handed one to her.

36
00:02:33.887 --> 00:02:37.856
"It's so smooth," Mandy said.

37
00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:43.682
"One day I will make bowls like that too," said Gildong proudly.

38
00:02:43.683 --> 00:02:48.222
The woman thanked the children for bringing the bowls.

39
00:02:48.223 --> 00:02:52.891
"You must have a snack before you leave," she said.

40
00:02:52.892 --> 00:02:55.672
"Have a seat and wait here.

41
00:02:55.673 --> 00:02:59.625
I will be back in a few minutes."

42
00:02:59.626 --> 00:03:02.005
The woman soon returned.

43
00:03:02.006 --> 00:03:05.938
She was carrying a tray of snacks for the children.

44
00:03:05.939 --> 00:03:09.740
"Mmm . . . These are so sweet!

45
00:03:09.741 --> 00:03:11.391
What are they?"

46
00:03:11.639 --> 00:03:15.314
Mandy asked, chewing on an orange fruit.

47
00:03:15.315 --> 00:03:18.811
"They are dried persimmons," Gildong answered.

48
00:03:18.812 --> 00:03:21.821
"And these are rice cakes."

49
00:03:21.822 --> 00:03:26.480
He popped a soft white rice cake into his mouth.

50
00:03:26.481 --> 00:03:31.685
When they were finished, Gildong stood and bowed to the woman.

51
00:03:31.686 --> 00:03:34.513
"Thank you," he said.

52
00:03:34.514 --> 00:03:38.279
Vinnie and Mandy hopped up too and bowed.

53
00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:43.032
"Thank you!" they said. "Good-bye!"

54
00:03:43.033 --> 00:03:45.908
The children left the house.

55
00:03:45.909 --> 00:03:48.813
Suddenly Gildong stopped.

56
00:03:48.814 --> 00:03:53.912
"Hmm," he said. "Do you hear something?"

57
00:03:53.913 --> 00:03:56.450
Mandy's face lit up.

58
00:03:56.451 --> 00:04:05.182
"Yes!" she said. "I hear music!"
